<view class="head">
  <view class="head-inner">
    <view class="head-eyebrow">管理員</view>
    <view class="head-title">建立問卷</view>
    <view class="head-sub">預設已套用 5W 題目，可直接修改、增删，或用 ▲▼ 調順序</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="wrap">
  <view class="card card--overlap">
    <view class="sec-title">基本信息</view>

    <view class="label">問卷標題</view>
    <textarea class="textarea title-box" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle" placeholder="例：十月新流程群公告確認" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="100" auto-height />

    <view class="label">群名稱（選填，用於標識這份問卷）</view>
    <view class="tags" wx:if="{{groupNames.length}}">
      <view class="g-tag" wx:for="{{groupNames}}" wx:key="*this">
        <text>{{item}}</text>
        <text class="g-del" hover-class="opt-hover" data-name="{{item}}" bindtap="removeGroupName">✕</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <input class="input" style="flex:1" value="{{groupInput}}" bindinput="onGroupInput" placeholder="例：生產部群" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="100" confirm-type="完成" bindconfirm="addGroupName" />
      <view class="add-tag" hover-class="opt-hover" bindtap="addGroupName">加入</view>
    </view>
    <view class="inline-link" hover-class="opt-hover" bindtap="pasteGroupName">從剪貼簿貼上群名</view>
    <view class="saved" wx:if="{{savedList.length}}">
      <view class="label" style="margin-top:0">常用群名（點一下加入，再點取消）</view>
      <view class="tags">
        <view class="g-tag {{item.on ? 'g-tag--on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" wx:for="{{savedList}}" wx:key="name" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="toggleSaved">{{item.on ? '✓ ' : '＋ '}}{{item.name}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">選填。小程序讀不到微信群名（微信限制），這裡填寫的只是這份問卷的標識，用於列表顯示與匯出；常用群名會記在這台手機上。</view>

    <view class="label">公告內容</view>
    <textarea class="textarea" value="{{announcement}}" bindinput="onAnnouncement" placeholder="把群公告全文貼在這裡，成員答題時會看到這一段" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="20000" />
    <view class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="pasteAnnouncement">從剪貼簿貼上</button>
    </view>

    <view class="label">作答範圍</view>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view class="chip {{bindMode === 'group' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-mode="group" bindtap="setBindMode">綁定群組</view>
      <view class="chip {{bindMode === 'open' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-mode="open" bindtap="setBindMode">開放作答</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">綁定群組：只有從微信群卡片進入的人能提交（可同時歸屬多個群）。開放作答：拿到卡片的人都能答。</view>

    <view class="label">填寫人姓名</view>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view class="chip {{nameMode === 'none' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-mode="none" bindtap="setNameMode">不收集</view>
      <view class="chip {{nameMode === 'optional' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-mode="optional" bindtap="setNameMode">選填</view>
      <view class="chip {{nameMode === 'required' ? 'chip-on' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-mode="required" bindtap="setNameMode">必填</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{nameMode === 'none'}}">微信不允許小程序自動讀取成員的微信暱稱；需要知道是誰交的，建議選「選填」或「必填」。</view>
    <view class="hint" wx:else>會在題目最前面自動加一題「你的姓名／稱呼」（{{nameMode === 'required' ? '必填' : '選填'}}），匯出時也會有這一欄。</view>

    <view class="label">截止日期（可選）</view>
    <picker mode="date" value="{{deadlineDate}}" start="{{today}}" bindchange="onDeadline">
      <view class="field {{deadlineDate ? 'field-set' : ''}}">{{deadlineDate || '不設定（手動結束）'}}</view>
    </picker>
    <view class="inline-link" wx:if="{{deadlineDate}}" hover-class="opt-hover" bindtap="clearDeadline">清除截止日期</view>
    <view class="hint">到期當天 23:59（+8）自動停止接收答案。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom:0">題目（{{questions.length}}）</view>
      <view class="add-btn" hover-class="opt-hover" bindtap="addQuestion">＋ 加一題</view>
    </view>

    <view class="q-card" wx:for="{{questions}}" wx:key="uid">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="q-no">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="q-tools">
          <view class="mv {{index === 0 ? 'mv-off' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-index="{{index}}" data-dir="-1" bindtap="moveQuestion">▲</view>
          <view class="mv {{index === questions.length - 1 ? 'mv-off' : ''}}" hover-class="opt-hover" data-index="{{index}}" data-dir="1" bindtap="moveQuestion">▼</view>
          <picker range="{{typeLabels}}" value="{{item.typeIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onQuestionType">
            <view class="type-pill">{{typeLabels[item.typeIndex]}} ▾</view>
          </picker>
          <view class="del" hover-class="opt-hover" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeQuestion">刪除</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <textarea class="textarea q-title" value="{{item.title}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onQuestionTitle" placeholder="題目內容" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="300" />

      <view wx:if="{{item.type === 'choice'}}" class="opt-editor">
        <input class="input" value="{{item.optionsText}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onQuestionOptions" placeholder="選項用逗號分隔：同意，有疑問，不同意" placeholder-class="ph" />
      </view>

      <view class="q-foot">
        <view class="req-toggle">
          <switch checked="{{item.required}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onQuestionRequired" color="#4F46E5" style="transform:scale(0.72)" />
          <text class="muted">必填</text>
        </view>
        <view class="faint">key：{{item.k}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="submit-bar">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">建立問卷</button>
    <view class="hint" style="text-align:center">建立後可立刻分享問卷卡片到微信群</view>
  </view>
</view>
